            "Runs the awaitables ==concurrently==, returns results as a **list**",
            "Results come back in ==argument order==, not completion order",
            "Bare coroutines are __wrapped in Tasks__ automatically"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def main():",
            "    r1, r2 = await gather(",
            "        fetch(a), fetch(b))",
            "    # r1 is fetch(a), always",
            "    # r2 is fetch(b)"
          ],
          "note": "unpack by argument order, not finish"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
